    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ways to pay",
     "texto": [
      "**现金** is cash; **卡** is card and **银行卡**, bank card. **付钱** means to pay. **人民币** is the Chinese currency, the renminbi; in everyday prices you often hear 块.",
      "**带** means to carry or to bring. If you ask whether you can pay by card, say **可以用银行卡吗？**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
