    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Change",
     "texto": [
      "**找钱** is formed from 找 («to give change») and 钱 («money»). You can ask **一共多少钱？** («how much is it in total?»). In English we also often say «How much is it?» without naming the money."
     ],
